{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16984","headline":"长安秋夜怀陈京昆季 · 武元衡","name":"长安秋夜怀陈京昆季","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钟鼓九衢绝，出门千里同。\n远情高枕夜，秋思北窗空。\n静见烟凝烛，闲听叶坠桐。\n玉壶思洞彻，琼树忆葱笼。\n萤影疎帘外，鸿声暗雨中。\n羇愁难会面，嬾慢责微躬。\n甲乙科攀桂，图书阁践蓬。\n一瓢非可乐，六翮未因风。\n寥落悲秋尽，蹉跎惜岁穷。\n明朝不相见，流泪菊花丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16984.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16984","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}